        <h1>Ability of Polyethylene Glycol Interleukin-2 (PEG-IL2) to Counteract the Effect of Spaceflight on the Rat Immune System</h1>
        <div class="meta-id">Record ID: CPIMM01</div>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
